    owl:definition "Assembly consisting of sections containing a fan or fans and other necessary equipment to perform one or more of the following functions: circulating, filtration, heating, cooling, heat recovery, humidifying, dehumidifying, and mixing of air. Is usually connected to an air-distribution system." .

ex:Air_Loop a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Air Loop" ;
